    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Charming Two-Bedroom End-Terraced Home with Large Rear Garden\r\n\r\nWe are delighted to present 7 Bells Terrace, Pearse Road, Sligo, a well-located two-bedroom end-terraced home situated within easy walking distance of Sligo town centre and a superb range of local amenities.\r\n\r\nThe property is ideally positioned close to shops, supermarkets, schools, churches and leisure facilities, making it a particularly convenient location for those wishing to enjoy town living.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is well presented and comprises an Entrance Hall, Dining Room with arched opening to the Living Room, Kitchen & Shower room at ground floor level, with two bedrooms overhead.\r\n\r\nThis townhouse residence enjoys an extra-large rear garden, with the benefit of a rear entrance, providing useful access for refuse collection, deliveries and general maintenance. There is also a block-built boiler house / garden store.\r\n\r\nThe property has undergone a number of significant recent improvements, including a new roof, new attic insulation, newly reconstructed chimney, new condensing boiler and recently installed double-glazed windows and doors.\r\n\r\nAn ideal opportunity for first-time buyers, those looking to downsize, or investors."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\r\nTiled Floor\r\n\r\nDining Room\r\n3.3m x 2.6m\r\nLaminate Wood Flooring\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\n3.1m x 3.0m\r\nLaminate Wood Flooring. Antique Fireplace.\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\n3.8m x 2.3m\r\nTiled Floor. All appliances included.\r\n\r\nShower Room\r\n2.2m x 2.1m\r\nFully Tiled. Electric shower.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nBedroom No.1\r\n4.0m x 2.8m\r\nLaminate Wood Flooring\r\n\r\nBedroom No.2\r\nFitted Wardrobe. Laminate Wood Flooring\r\n\r\nLanding with Hot Press."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Oil Fired Central Heating. Recently installed energy efficient oil boiler.\r\nDouble glazed uPVC windows. \r\nNew roof & newly reconstructed chimney.\r\nNew attic insulation.\r\nLarge west facing garden with back entrance.\r\nBlock built garden store & boiler house (2.6m x 2.6m).\r\nConvenient to all amenities in Sligo town centre."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: F"
      }
